@startuml
component "media-service" as Media
component "transcoder-service" as Transcoder
component "notification-service" as Notification
database "media_db\nvideo, rendition" as MediaDb
database "notification_db\nnotification" as NotificationDb
storage "media_data\nsource + rendition bytes" as Files

Media --> MediaDb : exclusive credentials
Notification --> NotificationDb : exclusive credentials
Media --> Files : upload/read/download
Transcoder --> Files : read source/write rendition
note right of Transcoder
  No business database.
  Metadata arrives in commands.
end note
@enduml
